<title>EGYPT: Medinet Nasr 1996/97 Q3 pre-tax profit up.</title>
<headline>Medinet Nasr 1996/97 Q3 pre-tax profit up.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt realty firm Medinet Nasr Housing and Development said in a published announcement on Wednesday that pre-tax profits were 156.377 million pounds in the first nine months of 1996/97.</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit in the first nine months of 1995/96 was 68.750 million pounds, it said. The financial years start on July 1.</p>
<p>Total sales in the third quarter of 1996/97 were 101.878 million pounds compared to 93.750 million pounds in 1995/96.</p>
</text>
